From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 10:15:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] sxs: Use a global name for the mutex of the side-by-side
 assembly cache.

What it guards is the machine's, and services run in session 0: with a name of each session's own, a
service and a program of the user's session did not exclude each other.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/dlls/sxs/cache.c b/dlls/sxs/cache.c
index ed6ca099a95..5054a45411f 100644
--- a/dlls/sxs/cache.c
+++ b/dlls/sxs/cache.c
@@ -35,7 +35,8 @@
 
 WINE_DEFAULT_DEBUG_CHANNEL(sxs);
 
-static const WCHAR cache_mutex_nameW[] = L"__WINE_SXS_CACHE_MUTEX__";
+/* a global one: the cache is the machine's, and services run in another session */
+static const WCHAR cache_mutex_nameW[] = L"Global\\__WINE_SXS_CACHE_MUTEX__";
 
 struct cache
 {
